    {
      "id": 1406,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37060,
        "text_offset": 40750,
        "length": 66,
        "text": "The switch /Y may be preset in the COPYCMD environment variable.\r\n",
        "bytes": "54686520737769746368202f59206d61792062652070726573657420696e2074686520434f5059434d4420656e7669726f6e6d656e74207661726961626c652e0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 601,
        "text_offset": 5203,
        "length": 121,
        "text": "The switch /Y may be preset in the COPYCMD environment variable.\r\nThis may be overridden with /-Y on the command line\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "54686520737769746368202f59206d61792062652070726573657420696e2074686520434f5059434d4420656e7669726f6e6d656e74207661726961626c652e0d0a54686973206d6179206265206f76657272696464656e2077697468202f2d59206f6e2074686520636f6d6d616e64206c696e650d0a0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1440,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37072,
        "text_offset": 41092,
        "length": 93,
        "text": "Displays or sets the date.\r\n\r\nDATE [mm-dd-yy]\r\n\r\n  mm-dd-yy    Sets the date you specify.\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "446973706c617973206f7220736574732074686520646174652e0d0a0d0a44415445205b6d6d2d64642d79795d0d0a0d0a20206d6d2d64642d7979202020205365747320746865206461746520796f7520737065636966792e0d0a0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 613,
        "text_offset": 5600,
        "length": 45,
        "text": "Displays or sets the date.\r\n\r\nDATE [date]\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "446973706c617973206f7220736574732074686520646174652e0d0a0d0a44415445205b646174655d0d0a0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1462,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37088,
        "text_offset": 41551,
        "length": 79,
        "text": "  /P                      Prompts for confirmation before deleting each file.\r\n",
        "bytes": "20202f502020202020202020202020202020202020202020202050726f6d70747320666f7220636f6e6669726d6174696f6e206265666f72652064656c6574696e6720656163682066696c652e0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 629,
        "text_offset": 6011,
        "length": 59,
        "text": "  /P\t\tPrompts for confirmation before deleting each file.\r\n",
        "bytes": "20202f50090950726f6d70747320666f7220636f6e6669726d6174696f6e206265666f72652064656c6574696e6720656163682066696c652e0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1482,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37100,
        "text_offset": 41800,
        "length": 80,
        "text": "  [drive:][path][filename]   Specifies drive, directory, and/or files to list.\r\n",
        "bytes": "20205b64726976653a5d5b706174685d5b66696c656e616d655d2020205370656369666965732064726976652c206469726563746f72792c20616e642f6f722066696c657320746f206c6973742e0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 641,
        "text_offset": 6410,
        "length": 97,
        "text": "  /P          Pauses after each screenful of information.\r\n  /W          Uses wide list format.\r\n",
        "bytes": "20202f502020202020202020202050617573657320616674657220656163682073637265656e66756c206f6620696e666f726d6174696f6e2e0d0a20202f5720202020202020202020557365732077696465206c69737420666f726d61742e0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1483,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37104,
        "text_offset": 41881,
        "length": 89,
        "text": "  /P      Pauses after each screenful of information.\r\n  /W      Uses wide list format.\r\n",
        "bytes": "20202f5020202020202050617573657320616674657220656163682073637265656e66756c206f6620696e666f726d6174696f6e2e0d0a20202f57202020202020557365732077696465206c69737420666f726d61742e0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 645,
        "text_offset": 6508,
        "length": 122,
        "text": "  /A          Displays files with specified attributes.\r\n  attributes   D  Directories                R  Read-only files\r\n",
        "bytes": "20202f4120202020202020202020446973706c6179732066696c657320776974682073706563696669656420617474726962757465732e0d0a2020617474726962757465732020204420204469726563746f7269657320202020202020202020202020202020522020526561642d6f6e6c792066696c65730d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1485,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37112,
        "text_offset": 42098,
        "length": 123,
        "text": "            S  System files  A  Files ready to archive  -  Prefix meaning \"not\"\r\n  /O      List by files in sorted order.\r\n",
        "bytes": "20202020202020202020202053202053797374656d2066696c6573202041202046696c657320726561647920746f206172636869766520202d2020507265666978206d65616e696e6720226e6f74220d0a20202f4f2020202020204c6973742062792066696c657320696e20736f72746564206f726465722e0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 653,
        "text_offset": 6821,
        "length": 155,
        "text": "  sortorder    N  By name (alphabetic)       S  By size (smallest first)\r\n               E  By extension (alphabetic)  D  By date & time (earliest first)\r\n",
        "bytes": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1487,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37120,
        "text_offset": 42372,
        "length": 70,
        "text": "            G  Group directories first    -  Prefix to reverse order\r\n",
        "bytes": "20202020202020202020202047202047726f7570206469726563746f72696573206669727374202020202d202050726566697820746f2072657665727365206f726465720d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 661,
        "text_offset": 7184,
        "length": 131,
        "text": "  /B          Uses bare format (no heading information or summary).\r\n  /L          Uses lowercase.\r\n  /V          Verbose mode.\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "20202f422020202020202020202055736573206261726520666f726d617420286e6f2068656164696e6720696e666f726d6174696f6e206f722073756d6d617279292e0d0a20202f4c2020202020202020202055736573206c6f776572636173652e0d0a20202f5620202020202020202020566572626f7365206d6f64652e0d0a0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1488,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37124,
        "text_offset": 42443,
        "length": 127,
        "text": "            C  By compression ratio (smallest first)\r\n  /S      Displays files in specified directory and all subdirectories.\r\n",
        "bytes": "202020202020202020202020432020427920636f6d7072657373696f6e20726174696f2028736d616c6c657374206669727374290d0a20202f53202020202020446973706c6179732066696c657320696e20737065636966696564206469726563746f727920616e6420616c6c207375626469726563746f726965732e0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 665,
        "text_offset": 7316,
        "length": 146,
        "text": "Switches may be preset in the DIRCMD environment variable.  Override\r\npreset switches by prefixing any switch with - (hyphen)--for example, /-W.\r\n",
        "bytes": "5377697463686573206d61792062652070726573657420696e2074686520444952434d4420656e7669726f6e6d656e74207661726961626c652e20204f766572726964650d0a70726573657420737769746368657320627920707265666978696e6720616e79207377697463682077697468202d202868797068656e292d2d666f72206578616d706c652c202f2d572e0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1541,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37164,
        "text_offset": 43167,
        "length": 107,
        "text": "Type PATH ; to clear all search-path settings and direct MS-DOS to search\r\nonly in the current directory.\r\n",
        "bytes": "547970652050415448203b20746f20636c65617220616c6c207365617263682d706174682073657474696e677320616e6420646972656374204d532d444f5320746f207365617263680d0a6f6e6c7920696e207468652063757272656e74206469726563746f72792e0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 681,
        "text_offset": 7682,
        "length": 108,
        "text": "Type PATH ; to clear all search-path settings and direct Windows to search\r\nonly in the current directory.\r\n",
        "bytes": "547970652050415448203b20746f20636c65617220616c6c207365617263682d706174682073657474696e677320616e64206469726563742057696e646f777320746f207365617263680d0a6f6e6c7920696e207468652063757272656e74206469726563746f72792e0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1560,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37172,
        "text_offset": 43335,
        "length": 55,
        "text": "Changes the MS-DOS command prompt.\r\n\r\nPROMPT [text]\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "4368616e67657320746865204d532d444f5320636f6d6d616e642070726f6d70742e0d0a0d0a50524f4d5054205b746578745d0d0a0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 689,
        "text_offset": 7851,
        "length": 56,
        "text": "Changes the Windows command prompt.\r\n\r\nPROMPT [text]\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "4368616e676573207468652057696e646f777320636f6d6d616e642070726f6d70742e0d0a0d0a50524f4d5054205b746578745d0d0a0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1564,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37188,
        "text_offset": 43607,
        "length": 61,
        "text": "  $P   Current drive and path\r\n  $V   MS-DOS version number\r\n",
        "bytes": "2020245020202043757272656e7420647269766520616e6420706174680d0a202024562020204d532d444f532076657273696f6e206e756d6265720d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 705,
        "text_offset": 8124,
        "length": 62,
        "text": "  $P   Current drive and path\r\n  $V   Windows version number\r\n",
        "bytes": "2020245020202043757272656e7420647269766520616e6420706174680d0a2020245620202057696e646f77732076657273696f6e206e756d6265720d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1600,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37212,
        "text_offset": 44038,
        "length": 28,
        "text": "Renames a file or files.\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "52656e616d657320612066696c65206f722066696c65732e0d0a0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 729,
        "text_offset": 8556,
        "length": 50,
        "text": "Renames a file/directory or files/directories.\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "52656e616d657320612066696c652f6469726563746f7279206f722066696c65732f6469726563746f726965732e0d0a0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1601,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37216,
        "text_offset": 44067,
        "length": 83,
        "text": "RENAME [drive:][path]filename1 filename2\r\nREN [drive:][path]filename1 filename2\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "52454e414d45205b64726976653a5d5b706174685d66696c656e616d65312066696c656e616d65320d0a52454e205b64726976653a5d5b706174685d66696c656e616d65312066696c656e616d65320d0a0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 733,
        "text_offset": 8607,
        "length": 159,
        "text": "RENAME [drive:][path][directoryname1 | filename1] [directoryname2 | filename2]\r\nREN [drive:][path][directoryname1 | filename1] [directoryname2 | filename2]\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1620,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37224,
        "text_offset": 44312,
        "length": 87,
        "text": "Displays, sets, or removes MS-DOS environment variables.\r\n\r\nSET [variable=[string]]\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "446973706c6179732c20736574732c206f722072656d6f766573204d532d444f5320656e7669726f6e6d656e74207661726961626c65732e0d0a0d0a534554205b7661726961626c653d5b737472696e675d5d0d0a0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 741,
        "text_offset": 8840,
        "length": 88,
        "text": "Displays, sets, or removes Windows environment variables.\r\n\r\nSET [variable=[string]]\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "446973706c6179732c20736574732c206f722072656d6f7665732057696e646f777320656e7669726f6e6d656e74207661726961626c65732e0d0a0d0a534554205b7661726961626c653d5b737472696e675d5d0d0a0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1640,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37236,
        "text_offset": 44606,
        "length": 45,
        "text": "Displays or sets the time.\r\n\r\nTIME [time]\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "446973706c617973206f722073657473207468652074696d652e0d0a0d0a54494d45205b74696d655d0d0a0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 753,
        "text_offset": 9135,
        "length": 52,
        "text": "Displays or sets the system time.\r\n\r\nTIME [time]\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "446973706c617973206f722073657473207468652073797374656d2074696d652e0d0a0d0a54494d45205b74696d655d0d0a0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1641,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37240,
        "text_offset": 44652,
        "length": 131,
        "text": "Type TIME without parameters to display the current time setting and\r\na prompt for a new one.  Press ENTER to keep the same time.\r\n",
        "bytes": "547970652054494d4520776974686f757420706172616d657465727320746f20646973706c6179207468652063757272656e742074696d652073657474696e6720616e640d0a612070726f6d707420666f722061206e6577206f6e652e2020507265737320454e54455220746f206b656570207468652073616d652074696d652e0d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 757,
        "text_offset": 9188,
        "length": 131,
        "text": "Type TIME with no parameters to display the current time setting and a prompt\r\nfor a new one.  Press ENTER to keep the same time.\r\n",
        "bytes": "547970652054494d452077697468206e6f20706172616d657465727320746f20646973706c6179207468652063757272656e742074696d652073657474696e6720616e6420612070726f6d70740d0a666f722061206e6577206f6e652e2020507265737320454e54455220746f206b656570207468652073616d652074696d652e0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1660,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37244,
        "text_offset": 44784,
        "length": 70,
        "text": "Displays the contents of a text file.\r\n\r\nTYPE [drive:][path]filename\r\n",
        "bytes": "446973706c6179732074686520636f6e74656e7473206f66206120746578742066696c652e0d0a0d0a54595045205b64726976653a5d5b706174685d66696c656e616d650d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 761,
        "text_offset": 9320,
        "length": 71,
        "text": "Displays the contents of text files.\r\n\r\nTYPE [drive:][path]filename\r\n\r\n",
        "bytes": "446973706c6179732074686520636f6e74656e7473206f6620746578742066696c65732e0d0a0d0a54595045205b64726976653a5d5b706174685d66696c656e616d650d0a0d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1680,
      "reference": {
        "index": 37248,
        "text_offset": 44855,
        "length": 37,
        "text": "Displays the MS-DOS version.\r\n\r\nVER\r\n",
        "bytes": "446973706c61797320746865204d532d444f532076657273696f6e2e0d0a0d0a5645520d0a"
      },
      "target": {
        "index": 765,
        "text_offset": 9392,
        "length": 38,
        "text": "Displays the Windows version.\r\n\r\nVER\r\n",
        "bytes": "446973706c617973207468652057696e646f77732076657273696f6e2e0d0a0d0a5645520d0a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1780,
      "reference": {
